              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naku, mwana wa mũndũ, ĩyosee ũvyũ mũĩ; ta wenzi wa mwenzi ũkeeyosea, na ũkeenza mũtwe waku na kĩng’ew’a kyaku: nĩvo wĩosa kĩthimi kya kũthima nakyo, noiaan’ya nzw’ĩĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
